                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Strategy game in which you rotate a cube and position your troops to attack enemies from the side or behind\n\n✅Great game idea,fighting on the six sides of a rotating cube\n✅The cube rotation mechanics ,changing the orientation of the battlefield creates interesting attack and defense options\n✅Good graphics for 2016\n✅The relaxed pace of the game allows you to carefully analyze possible moves before making a decision\n ✅The price is good\n\n❌No graphics settings\n\n✅✅✅ Verdict: [strike] Terrible [/strike] , [strike] Bad [/strike] , [strike] Mediocre [/strike] , [strike] Decent [/strike] , [strike] Good [/strike] , [b] Very Good [/b] (Rating scale for short games, retro indie simulator games and similar)\n\n[quote]If you'd like to see more of my reviews, you can find them on my\ncurator page:\n[url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/45994324/admin/reviews_manage/]CuratorKingViking[/url]\nand on my group:\n[url=https://steamcommunity.com/groups/CuratorKingViking]GroupKingViking[/url]\n\nIf you have any questions about my reviews, feel free to ask.\nI'm happy to answer them. All reviews are my own!!\nBest regards, King Viking Bezimienny, Polish Game Reviewer. [/quote]",
